Skills: Go Language

Purpose:
  Go programming language skills organized by competency layers.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1  @INDEX.sdd
   2  @L1-fundamentals.sdd
   3  @L2-patterns.sdd
   4  @L3-concurrency.sdd
   5  @L4-microservices.sdd
   6  @L5-performance.sdd
   7  @testing/INDEX.sdd

Modes:
  LEARN    — learn Go fundamentals
  APPLY    — apply Go patterns to code
  REVIEW   — review Go skills
  UPGRADE  — propose Go skill upgrade

Rules:
  [G1]  Skills MUST follow Go idioms.
  [G2]  Skills MUST use Go tooling (go fmt, go vet).
  [G3]  Skills MUST handle errors explicitly.
  [G4]  Skills MUST use context for cancellation.
  [G5]  Skills MUST avoid shared mutable state.

Entry:
  Read:
    INDEX.sdd
    L1-fundamentals.sdd

  Resolve:
    L1-fundamentals
    L2-patterns
    L3-concurrency
    L4-microservices
    L5-performance

